OL,3,GNEWSACafe, gallery and library set for
OL,4,Aiconic building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe, art gallery and university
OL,7,Flibrary will be built inside one of a
OL,8,Fcity's most prominent buildings.
OL,10,FNorwich University of the Arts (NUA)
OL,11,Fhas been redeveloping the Grade II
OL,12,Flisted former Barclays on Bank Plain
OL,13,Fafter buying the site in 2022.
OL,15,FSince then it has added services
OL,16,Fincluding a canteen and students'
OL,17,Funion, and said its further plans would
OL,18,Fhelp secure the future of an "iconic
OL,19,Fbuilding".
OL,21,FThe city council approved the proposals
OL,22,Ffor its next stage of development.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
